#### 1. Access Control Issues
**Vulnerability Type:** Access control issues
**Severity:** Medium
**Affected Code Location:** `read_everything(stub)` function
**Description:** The `read_everything` function allows anyone to read all data in the ledger without any restrictions. This can lead to data leakage and unauthorized access.
**Recommended Fix:** Implement proper access control checks to ensure that only authorized users can read data.

